{"description": "Addresses #1911\r\n\r\nDocumentation is captured in [Taipy Doc issue #1183](https://github.com/Avaiga/taipy-doc/issues/1183) .\r\n\r\n```\r\nfrom taipy.gui import Gui\r\n\r\noptions = [(\"a\", \"Option A\"), (\"b\", \"Option B\"), (\"c\", \"Option C\"), (\"d\", \"Option D\")]\r\nselected = [\"a\", \"b\"]\r\n\r\ndef menu_action(state, id, payload):\r\n    if payload.get(\"args\")[0] in state.selected:\r\n        print(f\"Option {payload.get('args')[0]} is already selected\")\r\n\r\npage = \"\"\"\r\n<|menu|lov={options}|selected={selected}|on_action=menu_action|>\r\n\"\"\"\r\n\r\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\r\n    Gui(page).run(title=\"Menu\", port=3000, use_reloader=True, debug=True)\r\n```\r\n\r\nResult:\r\n<img width=\"683\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d0afa243-c9ed-43d6-a79d-6ae5a480a05a\">\r\n\r\n\r\n", "comments": [{"id": 1798145576, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "taipy/gui/viselements.json", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-13T08:01:30Z", "body": "I would prefer \"selected_ids\" for short and homogeneity.\r\nBy the way, the properties order is twisted. I would recommend:\r\n'lov', 'label', 'on_action', 'selected_ids', 'inactive_ids', 'adapter', 'type', 'width', 'width[mobile]'.\r\n\r\nThen the question is: how do we select/unselect items. Users have to handle that in `on_action` I imagine?"}, {"id": 1800597333, "in_reply_to_id": 1798145576, "path": "taipy/gui/viselements.json", "user": "namnguyen20999", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:23:28Z", "body": "I've added a logic to handle the select/unselect items. User no need to use on_action anymore"}, {"id": 1800606803, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_on_action.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:30:23Z", "body": "Although this is the proper way to do in Python, and you've used it elsewhere, I think it's simpler to use a raw 'print' (like in `doc/gui/examples/controls/table_guard_edits.py`, with the '# noqa: F401, T201' comment for linters)."}, {"id": 1800612217, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_label.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:34:18Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800612631, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_label.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:34:34Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\n    Gui(page).run(title=\"Menu - Label\")\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800613005, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_label.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:34:50Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\n<|menu|lov={options}|label=Pick an option|>\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800616208, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_label.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:37:08Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\noptions = [(\"a\", \"Option A\"), (\"b\", \"Option B\"), (\"c\", \"Option C\"), (\"d\", \"Option D\")]\r\n```\r\nShorter is better"}, {"id": 1800619059, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_inactive.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:39:16Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\n    Gui(page).run(title=\"Menu - Inactive\")\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800619218, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_inactive.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:39:23Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\npage= \"\"\"\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800619615, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_inactive.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:39:42Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\noptions = [(\"a\", \"Option A\"), (\"b\", \"Option B\"), (\"c\", \"Option C\"), (\"d\", \"Option D\")]\r\n```\r\nShorter is better"}, {"id": 1800622556, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_inactive_ids.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:41:42Z", "body": "Rename to \"menu_inactive_options\""}, {"id": 1800623009, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_inactive_ids.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:42:02Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\noptions = [(\"a\", \"Option A\"), (\"b\", \"Option B\"), (\"c\", \"Option C\"), (\"d\", \"Option D\")]\r\ninactive_ids = [\"a\", \"c\"]\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800624612, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_inactive_ids.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:43:14Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\ninactive_options = [\"a\", \"c\"]\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800624768, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_inactive_ids.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:43:21Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\npage = \"\"\"\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800625130, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_inactive_ids.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:43:39Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\n    Gui(page).run(title=\"Menu - Inactive options\")\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800625910, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_label.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:44:13Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\npage = \"\"\"\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800627786, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_on_action.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:45:30Z", "body": "Remove these please"}, {"id": 1800631463, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_on_action.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:48:02Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\noptions = [(\"a\", \"Option A\"), (\"b\", \"Option B\"), (\"c\", \"Option C\"), (\"d\", \"Option D\")]\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800631896, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_on_action.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:48:20Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\n```\r\nNot the topic of this example"}, {"id": 1800632389, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_on_action.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:48:41Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\npage = \"\"\"\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800632869, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_on_action.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:49:02Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\n    Gui(page).run(title=\"Menu - Action\")\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800634664, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_on_action.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:50:19Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\n<|menu|lov={options}|on_action=menu_action|>\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800638510, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_on_action.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:53:03Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\ndef menu_action(_1, _2, payload)\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800640973, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_on_action.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:54:37Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\n    selected_options = payload[\"args\"]\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800641380, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_on_action.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:54:50Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\n    for option in selected_options:\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800641858, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_on_action.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:55:08Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\n        print(f\"Menu option {option} selected\")  # noqa: F401, T201\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800648074, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_selected_ids.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:59:12Z", "body": "Rename to menu_selected_options.\r\n\r\nThis example does not seem to work... options are NOT selected when the app starts."}, {"id": 1800651616, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_selected_ids.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T08:01:18Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\n    Gui(page).run(title=\"Menu - Selected options\")\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800651945, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_selected_ids.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T08:01:32Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\n<|menu|lov={options}|selected_ids={selected_options}|>\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800652283, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_selected_ids.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T08:01:48Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\nselected_options = [\"a\", \"c\"]\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800652638, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_selected_ids.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T08:02:03Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\noptions = [(\"a\", \"Option A\"), (\"b\", \"Option B\"), (\"c\", \"Option C\"), (\"d\", \"Option D\")]\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800653855, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_inactive_ids.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T08:02:51Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\n<|menu|lov={options}|inactive_ids={inactive_options}|>\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800656300, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_inactive.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T08:04:35Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\n<|menu|lov={options}|not active|>\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800666185, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_simple.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T08:11:14Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\noptions = [(\"a\", \"Option A\"), (\"b\", \"Option B\"), (\"c\", \"Option C\"), (\"d\", \"Option D\")]\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800666398, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_simple.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T08:11:23Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\n<|menu|lov={options}|>\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800666513, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_simple.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T08:11:29Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\npage = \"\"\"\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800666816, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "doc/gui/examples/controls/menu_simple.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-15T08:11:41Z", "body": "```suggestion\r\n    Gui(page).run(title=\"Menu - Simple\")\r\n```"}, {"id": 1800819143, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "taipy/gui/_renderers/factory.py", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-15T09:44:54Z", "body": "`selected_ids` should be named `selected_items` and have property type `lov_value` if it is the result of the selection of `lov`"}, {"id": 1800821824, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/lovUtils.tsx", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-15T09:46:41Z", "body": "that would be value & defaultValue"}, {"id": 1800822846, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/MenuCtl.tsx", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-15T09:47:22Z", "body": "unnecessary, just handle value & defaultValue"}, {"id": 1800823322, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/MenuCtl.tsx", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-15T09:47:40Z", "body": "unnecessary"}, {"id": 1800825243, "in_reply_to_id": 1800823322, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/MenuCtl.tsx", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-15T09:48:51Z", "body": "value should be updated on the frontend by giving specifying rel_var so that LoVItems can be assigned to the value (multiple)"}, {"id": 1802584231, "in_reply_to_id": 1800822846, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/MenuCtl.tsx", "user": "namnguyen20999", "created_at": "2024-10-16T08:14:24Z", "body": "but if we use value & defaultValue to handle the selected_ids/items then we need to set it as default value right ? "}, {"id": 1802794267, "in_reply_to_id": 1800822846, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/MenuCtl.tsx", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-16T10:07:59Z", "body": "I suppose you mean default property ? \r\nNo it is not necessary, just need to change from using updateVarName togetUpdateVar(props.updateVars, \"<property name>\")"}, {"id": 1803046992, "in_reply_to_id": 1800819143, "path": "taipy/gui/_renderers/factory.py", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-16T12:51:44Z", "body": "As we discussed this morning... that would be 'selected' for short, and yes, hold lov elements. Not ids.\r\nThe difference with 'inactive' (and ids) is that the 'inactive' is never updated from the frontend\r\n"}, {"id": 1804182852, "in_reply_to_id": 1798145576, "path": "taipy/gui/viselements.json", "user": "FabienLelaquais", "created_at": "2024-10-17T06:28:13Z", "body": "I guess you're saying that's done in 'on _change' which is fine.\r\nHowever 'on_action' is still invoked right (independent on the selected state of the item)?"}, {"id": 1804344310, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/Selector.tsx", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-17T08:32:41Z", "body": "Why changed a file for formatting only? it just adds noise to the reviewing process"}, {"id": 1804346503, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/context/wsUtils.ts", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-17T08:34:12Z", "body": "noise again"}, {"id": 1804369083, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/Menu.tsx", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-17T08:48:52Z", "body": "not working"}, {"id": 1808279297, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/MenuCtl.tsx", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-21T07:54:55Z", "body": "looks like there is no link between `inactiveIds` and `selected`, they should be in 2 separated `useMemo`"}, {"id": 1808284653, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/Menu.tsx", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-21T07:58:45Z", "body": "we don't want frontend->backend update for selected"}, {"id": 1808292193, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/Menu.tsx", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-21T08:04:27Z", "body": "Why is it not possible to re-use SingleItem ?"}, {"id": 1808294271, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "taipy/common/config/config.pyi", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-21T08:06:01Z", "body": "no need to commit this file which is not related to this issue"}, {"id": 1810122289, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/Menu.tsx", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-22T07:33:21Z", "body": "combine with current selection if any"}, {"id": 1810122889, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/Menu.tsx", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-22T07:33:42Z", "body": "is there a need after the useEffect ?"}, {"id": 1810262679, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/Menu.tsx", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-22T08:47:58Z", "body": "what if currentSelection is in props.selected or currentSelection is not defined ?"}, {"id": 1810264807, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/Menu.tsx", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-22T08:48:50Z", "body": "here you are replacing selectedValue by key ie loosing all previous selection"}, {"id": 1810265450, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/Menu.tsx", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-22T08:49:10Z", "body": "I don't think we need a separate selection management"}, {"id": 1810995724, "in_reply_to_id": 1810265450, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/Menu.tsx", "user": "namnguyen20999", "created_at": "2024-10-22T15:54:32Z", "body": "Removed in the latest commit"}, {"id": 1810996927, "in_reply_to_id": 1810262679, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/Menu.tsx", "user": "namnguyen20999", "created_at": "2024-10-22T15:55:18Z", "body": "this part has been removed in the latest commit, and being handled in the useCallback"}, {"id": 1811006601, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/Menu.tsx", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:01:40Z", "body": "no modification needed here"}, {"id": 1811007527, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/Menu.tsx", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:02:17Z", "body": "props.selected should have no impact here.\r\nso back to original code"}, {"id": 1811016128, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/Menu.tsx", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:08:18Z", "body": "No need for this"}, {"id": 1811050896, "in_reply_to_id": 1811016128, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/Menu.tsx", "user": "namnguyen20999", "created_at": "2024-10-22T16:32:36Z", "body": "you are right !! no need extra step here"}, {"id": 1811095066, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/Menu.tsx", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-22T17:05:16Z", "body": "why ?? and not || ?"}, {"id": 1811098383, "in_reply_to_id": 1811095066, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/Menu.tsx", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-22T17:08:02Z", "body": "or even better `const selected = Array.isArray(props.selected) ? props.selected : [];`"}, {"id": 1811117030, "in_reply_to_id": 1811095066, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/Menu.tsx", "user": "namnguyen20999", "created_at": "2024-10-22T17:23:07Z", "body": "updated"}, {"id": 1811121817, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "taipy/gui/viselements.json", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-22T17:26:51Z", "body": "\"type\": \"dynamic(list[str])\",\r\n\"doc\": \"Semicolon (';')-separated list or a list of menu items identifiers that should be selected.\""}, {"id": 1811142701, "in_reply_to_id": 1811121817, "path": "taipy/gui/viselements.json", "user": "namnguyen20999", "created_at": "2024-10-22T17:44:06Z", "body": "updated"}, {"id": 1811200286, "in_reply_to_id": null, "path": "frontend/taipy-gui/src/components/Taipy/Menu.tsx", "user": "FredLL-Avaiga", "created_at": "2024-10-22T18:31:08Z", "body": "declared but not used"}]}